	 *//**
	 * The number of SLAB pages that can't be freed up.
	 *//**
	 *
	 *//**
 * \brief Linux misc statistics
 *//**
	 * CPU awake cycles. When CPU is at full load, this will be at
	 * CPU clock speed (Hz) / stats interval (s)
	 *//**
