	 *//* Rate limit per sec for unknown data pkts *//* Ext Flags in qdrv_wlan *//* send ARP requests for unknown destinations *//* send unknown dest pkt to all bridge STAs *//* enqueue tx packets to AuC, not MuC *//* The 802.11 networking structure *//* Interrupts per MAC so we need a back pointer *//* Synchronization *//* For iounmap *//* Tx to MuC *//* Rx from MuC *//* Registers *//* rate tables *//* current rate table *//*congest queue stats*//* TX Beamforming support *//* Flow control *//* VSP is just enabled, need warm up for traffic stats *//* in seconds *//* sched sync task before next vsp interrupt from MuC *//*
	 * Used to sync stream stats every second. Since VSP check interval is bigger than 1 second,
