		 *//* This is called only from SCS Manual and SCS comparison task context *//* OCAC needs a DFS channel for which CAC is not already done *//* only calculate channel pair when low number 20M channel is already calculated *//* select worse channel as primary channel within the chan pair *//* only calculate channel set when all 20M channels are already calculated *//* select worst channel as primary channel within the best chan set *//* Need to calculate DFS channel metric in case current channel is DFS channel *//* All the sub-channel can't be primary channel *//* radar detected on this channel, secondary channel or secondary 40MHz channels*//* Weather channel has low priority since it need too long CAC time *//* Select best channel *//* Update best alternate channel information for fast switch *//* If the IEEE80211_CHAN_HT40D channel in 40MHz or IEEE80211_CHAN_VHT80_UU
