	 *//* cause the PHY state machine to schedule a link state check */// This is the case of no phy - need to force link speed/* Use GPIO to reset ODM PHY *//* Alloc bus structure *//* Initialize mii structure fields *//* if we are using ar8236 switch, the mdio ops are special *//* Since Linux 4.16 mii_bus embeds the IRQ array. *//* Register bus if we are using PHY *//*
