	 *//* EMAC_MAC_RX_START_THRESHOLD ignored in store & forward mode *//* clear ints *//* Multicast hash filter *//* Delay of about 50ms between PHY is resume and start auto negotiation *//* The vendor-only PM_QOS_POWER_EMAC class and PHY_QTNPM state do not exist in
