**//* wireless_send_event(..) *//* For vnet_send_ioctl() etc ... *//* To get to mac->reg-> .... *//* To get to qtn_stats_log .... *//* Delay prior to enabling hang detection *//*	ieee	rate	ctl	short	basic	phy			*//*	rate	100kbps	indx	pre	rate	type			*//*	ieee	rate	ctl	short	basic	phy			*//*	rate	100kbps	indx	pre	rate	type			*//*	ieee	rate	ctl		short	basic	phy			*//*	rate	100kbps	indx	pre		rate	type			*//*	ieee	rate	ctl	short	basic	phy			*//*	rate	100kbps	indx	pre	rate	type			*//*
 * Only legacy rate are been added to it. Other rate flags will be updated
