 * This function allocates an ie descriptor, construct it with ie payload buffer and
 * queue it to the list
 *//* This function is same as above but always append the descriptor as header. *//* if header wasn't there, then we need setup tail as same as header *//* Flush the liner memory so that MuC can rebuild the beacon ie via link list *//* This free the descriptor memory and reset the parameters *//*
	 * Always queue the beacon frame header on the list header position so that MuC
