		 * iw_encode_ext structure *//* convert to the format used by IEEE_80211_IOCTL_SETKEY *//* IEEE80211_UNUSED_CRYPTO_COMMANDS *//* make sure the size of each block_data member is large then IFNAMSIZ *//* NB: setoptie & getoptie are !IW_PRIV_SIZE_FIXED *//*
