EH0*///		if (1) printk("%s: ", __FUNCTION__); if (1) printk/* Inform cbk for overwriting fwt entries in order to maintain 1st level empty *//* Unicast only. Multicast must be handled by the calling code *//* place new entry in the top level hash table *//* prevent duplicates *//*
			 * end of chain reached. append to this entry
			 *//* entry doesn't exist *//* found *//* first and only entry with this hash *//* first in a linked list. copy second over first *//* Maintain the FWT databse entry for overwriting  scenario
				 * so we can keep table with same indexer. *//* remove this element, make prev skip this one *//* TODO - avoid entering illegal entries *//* HW tested the delete item in be *//* reverse MAC for be so user can see the mac id as the bridge print it *//* #ifndef CONSOLE_TEST *//* Determine chip revision for reflection detection. *//* initialize hardware fwt *//*SH0
