 *//* ic_flags *//* CONF: ATH FF enabled *//* CONF: ATH Turbo enabled*//* STATUS: promiscuous mode *//* STATUS: all multicast mode *//* NB: this is intentionally setup to be IEEE80211_CAPINFO_PRIVACY *//* CONF: privacy enabled *//* CONF: 11g w/o 11b sta's *//* CONF: update beacon XR element*//* STATUS: scanning *//* CONF: beacon cca info *//* STATUS: start IBSS *//* NB: this is intentionally setup to be IEEE80211_CAPINFO_SHORT_SLOTTIME *//* STATUS: use short slot time*//* CONF: Power mgmt enable *//* CONF: des_bssid is set *//* CONF: enable WME use *//* CONF: bg scan enabled *//* CONF: sw tx retry enabled *//* TX Power: fixed rate *//* CONF: IBSS creation enable *//* STATUS: use short preamble *//* CONF: do alignment pad *//* STATUS: protection enabled *//* STATUS: use barker preamble*//* STATUS: update beacon tim *//* CONF: WPA enabled *//* CONF: WPA2 enabled *//* CONF: WPA/WPA2 enabled *//* CONF: drop unencrypted *//* CONF: TKIP countermeasures *//* CONF: hide SSID in beacon *//* CONF: disable internal bridge *//* STATUS: update beacon wme *//* enable 11.h *//* force chanswitch *//* ic_flags_ext *//* CONF: 4 addr allowed *//* CONF: enable country IE *//* STATE: scan pending *//* STATE: enable full bgscan completion *//* CONF: enable U-APSD *//* STATUS: sleeping *//* drop uapsd EOSP frames for test *//* Enable marking of dfs interference *//* CONF: send regclassids in country ie *//* STATUS: update ERP element *//* CONF: use software beacon timer *//* CONF: drop unencrypted eapol frames *//* STATE: beacon APP IE updated *//* Enable 11n protection *//* CONF: A-MPDU supported *//* CONF: A-MSDU supported *//* use HT20 channel in 20/40 mode*//* CONF: 11n w/o non ht sta's *//* CONF: Work as a repeater *//* Temporarily use 20MHz channel when changing channel *//* on detection of radar, select a non-DFS channel and switch immediately *//* on detection of radar, only scan non-DFS channels *//* Fast reassociation after power up
