g command *//* Enable/Disable Topaz MuC rx accelerate *//* Enable/Disable lookup SA in FWT for rx accelerate *//* Set Max MPDU size to be supported *//* FIXME 247 is obsolete and do not reuse *//* Just perform specific SSID scan *//* FIXME 250 is obsolete and do not reuse *//* restart rate training to a particular node *//* AuC tx debug command *//* promote AC_BE to use aggresive medium contention *//* Set bandwidth and NSS used for a particular node *//* Config TID AC and priority at TAC_MAP, debug only *//* Config priority for VAP, used for TID priority at TAC_MAP *//* Tune QoS scheduling in AuC *//* turn on/off TxBF IOT to non QTN node *//* Current channel congestion index *//* Set courntry code for EU region *//* promote AC_BE to use aggresive medium contention - Q2Q case *//* Enable-Disable AMSDU support for 1SS devies - phone and tablets *//* Automatic adjusting WME bss param based on VAP priority *//* total number of TKIP MIC errors *//* Dump configured txpower for all channels *//* Enable/Disable EMI power switching *//* Configure the TX powers different bandwidths *//* Cancel any ongoing scanning *//* Set max spatial streams for VHT mode *//* Configure fixed tx bandwidth without changing BSS bandwidth *//* Smart Feature Select commands *//* Specify number of tunning packets to send for power detector tuning *//* Specify number of tunning packets to send for power detector tuning *//* Enable/Disable 802.11w / PMF *//* Enable/disable auto-cca-threshold feature *//* Configure the threshold parameter  *//* Configure the auto-cca debug flag *//* Intra BSS isolation *//* BSS isolation *//* Set max BF sounding receive STS *//* WDS mode *//* EXTENDER Device role *//* MBS best rssi threshold *//* RBS best rssi threshold *//* MBS RSSI weight *//* RBS RSSI weight *//* Set airtime fairness configuration *//* FIXME 289 is obsolete and do not reuse *//* RX AMSDU: 0 - disable, 1 - enable, 2 - enable dynamically *//* Get Disassoc reason *//* TX QoS hold-time table *//* The