p *//* Delete/disable qmat in mu group *//* Retrieve MU group and Q matrix info *//* Enable qmat in mu group *//* Set or clear MU debug flag *//* DSP debug verbocity level *//* Set DSP debug flag *//* Enables/disables CRC error to be passed to packet memory*//* Switch MU user_pos for debugging MU interference *//* Sets group select sounding period *//* Sets precoding sounding period *//* Enable install 1ss default matrix feature *//* Configure the threshold for install 1ss default matrix *//* interval to check scan results *//* Enable TDLS over qhop *//*select precoding algorithm, projection(1) or BD(2)*//*select ranking algorithm, projection(1) or BD(2)*//* Disable QMat for MU group *//* Get QMat status *//* Equalizer status *//* Initiate TX power table for a band with one single value *//* External L2 Filter *//* External L2 Filter port *//* Airtime padding for MU/SU Tx decision *//* Set Fixed MU AMSDU size *//* Seamless DFS, same as PARAM_OCAC *//* select mu ranking criteria *//* Enable RX optim stats *//* Set Max congest queue num for unicast *//* Set Management Frame Rate Control feature *//* Get/Set lock detect functionality enabled/disabled *//* OBSS scan exemption request*//* OBSS scan exemption request*//* Preferred band on dual band mode *//* Bandwidth in 2.4ghz band *//* allow VHT even only TKIP is set as cipher, for WFA testbed *//* Enable/disable auto-cs-threshold feature *//* Configure the threshold parameter  *//* Quantenna bgscan duration for an active channel *//* Quantenna bgscan duration for a passive channel *//* Quantenna bgscan duration for a passive channel *//* Quantenna bgscan duration for a passive channel *//* Quantenna bgscan fat threshold for passive fast mode *//* Quantenna bgscan fat threshold for passive normal mode *//* Block any association request for specified BSS *//* Quantenna 2.4G band feature -- VHT support *//* Hardware phy mode *//* the mapping between 8 VAPs and 4 HW event queues for beacon *//* enable/disable STA BMPS *//*