 * Platform dependant implement. Customer needs to modify this file.
 *//* WPS button event reported to user space process *//* timer interval *//*
* Queue of processes who access wps_button file
*//* records the jiffies when button down, back to 0 after button released *//* MSI *//* Legacy INTx *//* MSI *//* Legacy INTx *//* Clear pending interrupt *//* notify local watcher *//* notify ep the offline dbg info, if ep is ready*//* As usual, this read is always blocked untill wps button is pressed
	 * so increase the module reference to prevent it being unload during
	 * blocking read
	 *//* wait for valid WPS button event *//* read back empty string in signal wakeup case *//* after new event been handled, reset to none event *//* dev_attr_wps_button *//* records the falling edge jiffies *//* at rising edge *//* WPS button event is rising triggered -- when button
		 * being changed from active to inactive level.
		 *
		 * Different press time trigger different event
		 *//* wakeup the event waiting processes *//* wakeup the event waiting processes *//* back to 0 after rising edge *//* after button down more than 10s, begin change the mode led's state to notify user to release button *//* Restart the timer *//*
	 * Set up timer to poll the button.
	 * Request the GPIO resource and export it for userspace
	 *//* creeate the device file for user space use *//**
