	 *//* EMAC_MAC_RX_START_THRESHOLD ignored in store & forward mode *//* clear ints *//* Multicast hash filter *//* Delay of about 50ms between PHY is resume and start auto negotiation *//* The max time (in ms) to wait for statistics counters to return a value *//*
