*//* PTI response frame received *//* authorized for TDLS link data *//* Mask for TDLS PTI bits *//* reserve the low values for internal use *//* hw limitation for 128 node mode *//* for maximum 8 TIDs *//* values below this are used for "bad apple" nodes *//* Quantenna specific flags (ni_qtn_flags), do not modify in Auc *//* restricted tx enabled *//* use RTS to confirm node is lost *//* node support TX amsdu *//*
