 * along with this program; if not, write to the Free Software
 * Foundation, Inc., 51 Franklin Street, Fifth Floor, Boston, MA  02110-1301, USA.
 **//* Total number of congestion queues we will pre-allocated *//* Maximum number of packets in one queue *//* Maximum number of packets in all congest queues *//* Maximum number of congest queue for unicast frame *//* Budget for packet number consmued at softirq at one time *//* Congestion queue descriptor *//* The index of packet to be sent	*//* The index of packet to be append	*//* Total number of pending requests per queue*//* Packet number forwarded successfully *//* Packet number dropped due to transmission time-out *//* packet number dropped due to enqueue failure *//* 0: Fail, 1: Success *//* A pointer array, if queues[node_id][tid] is not NULL, node-tid queue is congested
	* and it will point to attached congested queue.
	*//* Counters *//* tasklet hook function called count *//* tried times on triggering to TQE *//* Used to check queue fullness *//* Total number of pending requests in all queues*//* Total congest queue count of unicast frame *//* Max unicast congest queue count*//**
* Return NULL if node-tid pair is not congested, not NULL otherwise.
