 * Beacon handler locking definitions.
 * Beacon locking 
 * UAPSD locking 
 *//* NB: beware, spin_is_locked() is unusable for !SMP *//* NB: beware, spin_is_locked() is unusable for !SMP *//*
 * Node locking definitions.
