 * number may be overridden by the driver and/or by
 * user configuration.
 *//* IEEE80211_ELEMID_TIM *//* DTIM count *//* DTIM period *//* bitmap control *//* variable-length bitmap *//* IEEE80211_ELEMID_SEC_CHAN_OFF *//* offset *//* IEEE80211_ELEMID_COUNTRY *//* ISO CC+(I)ndoor/(O)utdoor *//* starting channel *//* number channels *//* tx power cap *//* up to 4 sub bands *//* EPR information element flags *//* Atheros private advanced capabilities info *//* bits 3-6 reserved *//* Atheros OUI *//* Quantenna OUI *//* Pairing Protection *//* VSP configuration *//* TDLS *//* TDLS Information *//* Radio measurement special group *//* Radio measurement all group *//* SCS status report and control *//* WME IE between QSTA *//* WDS Extender Role *//* Extender BSSID *//* Extender specific states *//* NONE Role *//* MBS Role *//* RBS Role *//* current supported version *//* Group addressed traffic not allowed *//* TDLS TPK Handshake *//* current supported version *//* Apple Products *//* iPad *//* Ralink OUI *//* Realtek OUI *//* Edimax OUI *//*
