 *//* element ID *//* length in bytes *//* VHT capabilities info *//* supported MSC and NSS set *//* VHT capabilities flags *//* VHT mcs info extras *//* VHT capability macro *//* get macros *//* VHT capabilities (all bits) *//* B0-1 Max. MPDU Length *//* B2-3 Supported channel width *//* B4 RX LDPC support *//* B5 Short GI for 80MHz support *//* B6 Short GI for 160MHz support *//* B7 TX STBC *//* B8-10 RX STBC *//* B11 SU Beam-former *//* B12 SU Beam-formee *//* B13-15 Beamformee STS capability *//* B16-18 Number of sounding Dimensions *//* B19 MU Beam-formee VHT capability *//* B20 MU Beam-former VHT capability *//* B22 VHT variant HT control field *//* B23-25 Max. A-MPDU Length Exponent *//* B26-27 VHT Link Adaptation capable *//* B28 Rx Antenna pattern consistency *//* B29 Tx Antenna pattern consistency *//* B0-B15 RX VHT-MCS MAP for Spatial streams 1-8 *//* B32-B47 TX VHT-MCS MAP for Spatial streams 1-8 *//* VHT-MCS MAP entry for RX or TX MAP *//* B16-B28 RX Highest supported Long GI data rates *//* B48-B60 TX Highest supported Long GI data rates *//* set macros *//* VHT capabilities (all bits) *//* B0-1 Max. MPDU Length *//* B2-3 Supported channel width *//* B8-10 RX STBC *//* B13-15 Beamformee STS capability *//* B16-18 Number of sounding Dimensions *//* B23-25 Max. A-MPDU Length Exponent *//* B26-27 VHT Link Adaptation capable *//* B0-B15 RX VHT-MCS MAP for Spatial streams 1-8 *//* B16-B28 RX Highest supported Long GI data rates *//* B32-B47 TX VHT-MCS MAP for Spatial streams 1-8 *//* B48-B60 TX Highest supported Long GI data rates *//* VHT MCS MAP *//* VHT capabilities options *//* Defined in _ieee80211.h file *//*
 * 802.11ac VHT Operation element
 *//* element ID *//* length in bytes *//* VHT Operation info *//* basic VHT MSC and NSS set *//* VHT Operation Information *//* Channel width Octet 1 *//* Channel Center Frequency Segment 0 *//* Channel Center Frequency Segment 1 *//* Basic VHT-MCS and NSS Set  *//* Get macros *//* Channel width Octet 1 *//* Channel Center Frequency Segment 0 *//* Channel Center Frequency Segment 1 *//* Basic VHT-MCS and NSS Set  *//*
 * 802.11ac VHT Operating mode notification element
 *//*
 * 802.11ac Extended BSS Load element
 *//* element ID *//* length in bytes *//* MU-MIMO Capable station count *//* Spatial Stream Underutilization *//* Observable Secondary 20Mhz use *//* Observable Secondary 40Mhz use *//* Observable Secondary 80Mhz use *//*
