 * 802.11ac Channel Switch Wrapper element
 *//* element ID *//* length in byte *//*
 * 802.11ac AID element
 *//* element ID *//* length in byte *//* aid *//*
 * 802.11ac Quiet Channel element
 *//* element ID *//* length in byte *//* AP Quite Mode *//* AP Quite Count *//* AP Quite Period *//* AP Quite Duration *//* AP Quite Offset *//*
